{"id":"e08t1","name":"Catalog JSON Exports","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","input_dir"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>A marketplace receives the catalog of its sellers as JSON files in <code>input_dir/&lt;seller&gt;/</code>. Unlike JSON lines, each file contains <b>one JSON array</b>, written over many lines, of products like this:</p>\n<pre class=\"exv\">[\n  {\"product_id\": \"P1\", \"title\": \"Linen shirt\", \"base_price\": 25.0,\n   \"variants\": [{\"sku\": \"P1-S-W\", \"size\": \"S\", \"color\": \"white\", \"price\": null, \"stock\": 3},\n                {\"sku\": \"P1-M-W\", \"size\": \"M\", \"color\": \"white\", \"price\": 27.5, \"stock\": 0}]}\n]</pre>\n<p>Rules:</p>\n<ol><li>Only files ending with <code>.json</code> are read. The seller is the name of the folder.</li><li>Each variant becomes one row. A product without variants (missing or empty list) is ignored.</li><li>The price of a variant is its own <code>price</code>, or the <code>base_price</code> of its product when the variant price is <code>null</code> or missing.</li><li>A variant is <code>in_stock</code> when its <code>stock</code> is greater than <code>0</code>; a missing stock means <code>0</code>.</li><li>Sizes are upper-cased and colors are lower-cased and trimmed.</li></ol>\n<p>Your task is to return the columns <code>seller</code>, <code>product_id</code>, <code>sku</code>, <code>size</code>, <code>color</code>, <code>price</code> (double) and <code>in_stock</code> (boolean), sorted by <code>seller</code>, then <code>sku</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/atlas_shop/catalog.json</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">[\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P1\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P1\",\n    \"base_price\": 25.0,\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"P1-S-W\",\n        \"size\": \"s\",\n        \"color\": \" White\",\n        \"price\": null,\n        \"stock\": 3\n      },\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"P1-M-W\",\n        \"size\": \"M\",\n        \"color\": \"white\",\n        \"price\": 27.5,\n        \"stock\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P2\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P2\",\n    \"base_price\": 9.9,\n    \"variants\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P3\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P3\",\n    \"base_price\": 5.0\n  }\n]</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/atlas_shop/notes.txt</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">draft</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/dune/part1.json</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">[\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"Q1\",\n    \"title\": \"Item Q1\",\n    \"base_price\": 100.0,\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"Q1-XL\",\n        \"size\": \"xl \",\n        \"color\": \"BLACK\",\n        \"stock\": 2\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]</pre><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>seller</th><th>product_id</th><th>sku</th><th>size</th><th>color</th><th>price</th><th>in_stock</th></tr><tr><td>atlas_shop</td><td>P1</td><td>P1-M-W</td><td>M</td><td>white</td><td>27.5</td><td>false</td></tr><tr><td>atlas_shop</td><td>P1</td><td>P1-S-W</td><td>S</td><td>white</td><td>25.0</td><td>true</td></tr><tr><td>dune</td><td>Q1</td><td>Q1-XL</td><td>XL</td><td>black</td><td>100.0</td><td>true</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"import os\nfrom pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, input_dir: str) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return spark.read.json(input_dir)\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["JSON multi-lignes","multiLine","explode","valeur par défaut du parent"],"minutes":22,"source":"Kata Lab","files":{"root":"input_dir","files":{"atlas_shop/catalog.json":"[\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P1\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P1\",\n    \"base_price\": 25.0,\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"P1-S-W\",\n        \"size\": \"s\",\n        \"color\": \" White\",\n        \"price\": null,\n        \"stock\": 3\n      },\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"P1-M-W\",\n        \"size\": \"M\",\n        \"color\": \"white\",\n        \"price\": 27.5,\n        \"stock\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P2\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P2\",\n    \"base_price\": 9.9,\n    \"variants\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P3\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P3\",\n    \"base_price\": 5.0\n  }\n]","atlas_shop/notes.txt":"draft","dune/part1.json":"[\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"Q1\",\n    \"title\": \"Item Q1\",\n    \"base_price\": 100.0,\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"Q1-XL\",\n        \"size\": \"xl \",\n        \"color\": \"BLACK\",\n        \"stock\": 2\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]"}},"visible":[{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"atlas_shop/catalog.json":"[\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P1\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P1\",\n    \"base_price\": 25.0,\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"P1-S-W\",\n        \"size\": \"s\",\n        \"color\": \" White\",\n        \"price\": null,\n        \"stock\": 3\n      },\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"P1-M-W\",\n        \"size\": \"M\",\n        \"color\": \"white\",\n        \"price\": 27.5,\n        \"stock\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P2\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P2\",\n    \"base_price\": 9.9,\n    \"variants\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"P3\",\n    \"title\": \"Item P3\",\n    \"base_price\": 5.0\n  }\n]","atlas_shop/notes.txt":"draft","dune/part1.json":"[\n  {\n    \"product_id\": \"Q1\",\n    \"title\": \"Item Q1\",\n    \"base_price\": 100.0,\n    \"variants\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"Q1-XL\",\n        \"size\": \"xl \",\n        \"color\": \"BLACK\",\n        \"stock\": 2\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]"}}},"expected":{"columns":["seller","product_id","sku","size","color","price","in_stock"],"rows":[["atlas_shop","P1","P1-M-W","M","white",27.5,false],["atlas_shop","P1","P1-S-W","S","white",25.0,true],["dune","Q1","Q1-XL","XL","black",100.